# T_SCRE: Move on an item another session has deleted since the page came
# (the page answered with a row for item 99, which does not exist): the
# ITEM GET that finds its location for the pick list is answered 200, and
# the list is fetched again without the row.
# First Take out on item 1, refused as not part of an assembly: a refusal
# other than 200 leaves the page as it is, stale row and all.
S STALE
K ALT-C T ENTER
S NOTIN
K DOWN ALT-C M
S MOVEGONE
K ESC
